        <a href="/help/github-profile" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" title="Ver guía del modo público" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18); color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; transition: all 0.2s ease;">?</a>
